- **Email**: `setting/account/ChangeEmailDialog.tsx`
- **Password**: `setting/account/ChangePasswordDialog.tsx` (only shown when `user.hasPassword`), or `AddPassword.tsx` when there is no password

Relevant backend pieces:

- `apps/nestjs-backend/src/features/auth/local-auth/local-auth.controller.ts` + `local-auth.service.ts`: signin, signup, change email, change password, reset password
- `apps/nestjs-backend/src/features/auth/strategies/local.strategy.ts`: Passport-local `validate()`, with lockout via `signin:attempts:{email}` / `signin:lockout:{email}`
- `apps/nestjs-backend/src/features/auth/guard/local-auth.guard.ts`: runs the strategy, then `logIn()` (creates the session)
- `apps/nestjs-backend/src/features/mail-sender/mail-sender.service.ts`: `sendEmailVerifyCodeEmailOptions`, `checkSendMailRateLimit`
- `apps/nestjs-backend/src/cache/cache.service.ts` (Keyv) + `cache/types.ts`: typed cache keys
